//     is reserved, so it must fault for every access). For each, the fetch runs from S-mode and
//     from U-mode (code in the user alias), with every SUM x MXR combination. Expected: allowed iff
//     the encoding is valid, the U bit matches the mode (S-mode may access U=1 pages only with
//     SUM=1, and never fetch from them), and the type permission holds (loads: R, or X with MXR=1).
//     A fault is a page fault with xepc at the fetch, xtval 0 or the address, and SPP recording the
